## 枚举布局与判别式

```rust
use std::mem;

enum Color {
    Red,
    Green,
    Blue,
}

enum Shape {
    Circle(f64),
    Rectangle(f64, f64),
    Point,
}

fn main() {
    println!("Color: size={}", mem::size_of::<Color>());
    println!("Shape: size={}", mem::size_of::<Shape>());
    println!("Option<bool>: size={}", mem::size_of::<Option<bool>>());
    println!("Option<&i32>: size={}", mem::size_of::<Option<&i32>>());
}
```

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["枚举内存布局"] --> B["判别式 (discriminant)"]
    A --> C["最大变体的数据"]
    B --> D["标记当前是哪个变体"]
    C --> E["所有变体共享同一空间"]
```

